        <section class="section" id="our-story" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 id="story-heading">Our Story</h2>
                <p>The Café has been a cornerstone of Leavenworth, Kansas since October 2005. Founded in the historic Abernathy Building near the Centennial Bridge, the café began as a weekday breakfast and lunch spot serving daily specials, fresh sandwiches, soups, salads, and hearty home-style meals. Open Monday through Friday, The Café quickly became a local favorite, known for its warm atmosphere and consistently good food.</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">What started as a small community café grew into something more: a kitchen built on a genuine commitment to feeding people well, at every stage of life and for every occasion.</p>
            </div>

