        <section class="section section--alt" id="our-history" aria-labelledby="history-heading">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 id="history-heading">Our History</h2>
                <p>Over more than two decades, The Café has grown and evolved alongside the Leavenworth community. Since opening in 2005, the business has moved locations several times across the city, each move bringing The Café closer to where it needed to be. Through those changes, the team's dedication to quality and community never wavered.</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">In 2015, The Café stepped back from serving the public to focus on catering and to cook for the <strong>Meals on Wheels</strong> program alongside the Council on Aging, bringing home-prepared meals to seniors and neighbors throughout the Leavenworth area.</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Starting {{ site.opening.dayName }}, {{ site.opening.monthDay }}, 2026, The Café is open to the public again as an order-and-go deli at {{ site.address.street }}: breakfast and lunch, {{ site.opening.hoursDays }}.</p>
            </div>

